    "original_requirement": "构建一个小型生产线节拍监控系统，使用光电计数传感器 D2 记录产品通过数，按钮 D3 表示人工停线，蜂鸣器 D6、LED D13、TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）和串口。系统按每分钟目标产量进行节拍监控，实时显示累计产量和达成率；若连续 30 秒无产品通过或人工停线，则报警并记录停机事件。按钮 D7 用于切换显示目标、实际和停机次数。",
    "effective_requirement": "构建一个小型生产线节拍监控系统，使用光电计数传感器 D2 记录产品通过数，按钮 D3 表示人工停线，蜂鸣器 D6、LED D13、TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）和串口。系统按每分钟目标产量进行节拍监控，实时显示累计产量和达成率；若连续 30 秒无产品通过或人工停线，则报警并记录停机事件。按钮 D7 用于切换显示目标、实际和停机次数。\nResolved hardware configuration (authoritative pin assignments; original conflicts were explicitly remapped). This is a PARTIAL inventory of recognized roles, not a whitelist: all other explicit source wiring remains required. device_role identifies wiring only, not the final catalog operation: preserve requested PWM, calibration, thresholds, timers and all other behavior.\n{\"version\": \"configuration-defaults-v3\", \"board\": \"arduino:avr:uno\", \"devices\": [{\"device_role\": \"digital_input\", \"pin\": \"D3\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_input\", \"pin\": \"D7\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D13\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tone_output\", \"pin\": \"D6\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tm1637_number\", \"clk_pin\": \"D4\", \"dio_pin\": \"D5\"}], \"serial\": {\"baud\": 9600, \"framing\": \"line_or_idle\", \"idle_timeout_ms\": 20}}\nSerial baud=9600; framing=line_or_idle; idle_timeout_ms=20.",
